'''Witchfire Brew''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Stibnite Flask}}.

==Mechanics==
This flask creates a curse aura around the user, similar to {{il|Despair}} supported by {{il|Blasphemy Support}}. This effect does not bypass the [[Curse#Curse limit|curse limit]]. The Despair effect reduces Chaos Resistance by approximately 25% at baseline instead of the expected 30%.<ref>https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3450488</ref>

This curse aura's stats are affected by {{c|mod|#% increased Effect of your Curses}}, but not by {{c|mod|Flasks applied to you have #% increased Effect}}<ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/pathofexile/comments/4z8dvv/comment/d6u3v4p/</ref> or stats that only apply to [[skill]]s, like {{c|mod|% increased Area of Effect}} or {{c|mod|% increased Despair Curse Effect}}.

{{Item acquisition}}

==Ruthless mode==
Utility Flasks cannot gain charges while active in [[Ruthless mode]]. This flask also has a flask duration of 5.50 seconds instead.

